OL,3,GNEWSATT Races clerk stepping down after
OL,4,A15 years                               
OL,6,FThe Clerk of the Isle of Man TT Races  
OL,7,Fhas said he is stepping down after 15  
OL,8,Fyears.                                 
OL,10,FGary Thompson, the ninth person to hold
OL,11,Fthe role and one of the longest-serving
OL,12,Fclerks, said he felt it was "the right 
OL,13,Fto pass the baton on".                 
OL,15,FThe change is part of a "planned       
OL,16,Fleadership transition" and long term   
OL,17,Fsuccession process, organisers said.   
OL,19,FThompson said would remain in a        
OL,20,Fsupporting role, he was looking forward
OL,21,Fto "watching from the hedgerows in the 
OL,22,Ffuture".                               
